    <string name="about_open">OPEN</string>
    <string name="about_no_crash_reporter">FOLD has no crash reporter, so nothing is sent when something goes wrong — which means a problem only gets fixed if someone reports it. The issue form is filled in with the version, commit, Android release and device model, and nothing else. You see and edit all of it before it is sent.</string>

